# ================= P7bccd：upgrade ── E(c)（2′）gen/.stamp → tools.just → 刪進度檔 → 啟動器判定 =================
p7bce, F = newpage("流程 v2：upgrade ── E(c) upgrade vendor_kit（2′）收尾 → 啟動器驗第一行 → 終點（§3.4、v2.15-7）", N7E, COLS5W)
